{
  "$comment": [
    "Proposed pl patterns for src/data/claims-lint.json (patterns.pl of each rule) and src/data/keyword-map.json (seOwned.pl, seOwnedLead.pl, reserved.G1.pl). Drafted with the pl copy (M3, T3); merge is the lead's decision (wave-2 note).",
    "Covers every claims-lint rule with per-locale patterns except selection-translate (already has pl) and the '*'-only rules io-home and engine-claim.",
    "Flags are 'ui' (claims-lint) / 'iu' (keyword-map): \\p{L} is used instead of \\w (JS \\w and \\b are ASCII-only, so they miss ą ć ę ł ń ó ś ź ż), (?<!\\p{L}) / (?!\\p{L}) stand in for \\b, and \\s also matches the copy's no-break spaces (U+00A0).",
    "Tested in a private copy: 0 hits on src/locales/pl.json (exempt keys as in claims-lint.json), and every rule hits at least one counter-example (docs/redesign-2026/ops/m3/pl-qa.md, appendix A)."
  ],
